@startuml
title ExitPass + HikCentral Normal Flow\nProjection Sync + Live Vendor Resolve

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam participantPadding 24
skinparam boxPadding 12

actor "Parker / WebPay\nor Operator Console" as User
participant "Central PMS API" as Api
participant "Resolve Vendor Parking\nUse Case" as Resolve
participant "HikCentral Vendor PMS Adapter" as Adapter
participant "HikCentral OpenAPI" as HikCentral
participant "Projection Scheduler" as Scheduler
participant "Projection Sync Service" as Sync
database "ExitPass DB\nsessions + core schemas" as DB

box "Background projection path, non-authoritative read model" #EEF7FF
    Scheduler -> DB: Load due enabled site-scoped sync targets
    DB --> Scheduler: Target for site + parkingLotIndexCode = 1

    Scheduler -> Sync: Run projection sync target
    Sync -> Adapter: Get passageway records\nparkingLotIndexCode = 1
    Adapter -> HikCentral: POST /artemis/api/vehicle/v1/parkinglot/passageway/record
    HikCentral --> Adapter: 200, code=0,\npassageway records
    Adapter --> Sync: Normalized records

    Sync -> Sync: Normalize actual HikCentral fields\nparkingLotInfo.parkingLotIndexCode\npersonInfo.cardNum\ncarInfo.EnterTime/ExitTime
    Sync -> Sync: Convert +08:00 timestamps to UTC\nbefore PostgreSQL timestamptz write

    Sync -> DB: Upsert sessions.vendor_session_projections
    Sync -> DB: Update sessions.vendor_session_projection_sync_targets\nhealth=HEALTHY, last_success_at
    DB --> Scheduler: Projection sync completed
end box

note over DB
Projection data is a latest-known continuity snapshot only.
It is not parking-session authority, tariff authority,
payment finality, or exit authorization authority.
end note

box "Normal live resolve path, vendor remains authority" #F3FFF3
    User -> Api: POST /v1/vendor-parking/resolve\nsiteId, siteGroupId, vendorSystemId,\nticketReference/cardNum
    Api -> Resolve: Execute resolve command

    Resolve -> Adapter: Resolve live parking session and tariff\nusing ticket/card reference
    Adapter -> HikCentral: Live vendor lookup / fee calculation
    HikCentral --> Adapter: Parking session + tariff result
    Adapter --> Resolve: Vendor-authoritative session/tariff data

    Resolve -> Resolve: Validate and map vendor response
    Resolve -> Resolve: Convert vendor +08:00 timestamps to UTC\nbefore DB persistence

    Resolve -> DB: Insert/update core.parking_sessions
    Resolve -> DB: Insert core.tariff_snapshots
    DB --> Resolve: parking_session_id + tariff_snapshot_id

    Resolve --> Api: Resolved result
    Api --> User: 200 OK\nlookupOutcome=resolved\nparkingSessionId\ntariffSnapshotId\namount/currency
end box

note over Resolve,DB
Normal resolve may persist a parking session and tariff snapshot.
It must not create PaymentAttempt.
It must not infer payment finality.
It must not issue ExitAuthorization.
end note

@enduml

